WEBVTT

00:09:58.812 --> 00:10:02.799
and precisely because its roots are geopolitical,

00:10:02.799 --> 00:10:05.639
it means that solutions can be found,

00:10:05.639 --> 00:10:08.326
compromises can be struck,

00:10:08.326 --> 00:10:11.145
however difficult it yet may be.

00:10:11.145 --> 00:10:15.137
After all, it was Yitzhak Rabin himself who said,

00:10:15.137 --> 00:10:18.123
"You don't make peace with your friends.

00:10:18.123 --> 00:10:20.503
You make it with your enemies."

00:10:20.503 --> 00:10:21.938
Thank you.

00:10:21.938 --> 00:10:27.020
(Applause)